{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"needs_more_public_schema","failure_reason":"The task requires verifying after mutation that every selected song is liked, but the available public Spotify read APIs do not expose liked status. spotify.like_song returns only a message, which cannot verify the resulting state.","missing_public_schema_fields":["A liked-status field (for example, is_liked) in spotify.show_song_queue or another public read API that can report whether each selected song is liked"],"task_id":"ccb4494_2","task_family":"ccb4494","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"Cannot produce a compliant executable plan until liked state can be verified through a public read API.","steps":[]}